{"unit_id":"tag:00X0:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，函子（functor）<MATH_0001> 沿着<TEXTITOPEN_0001>相反（opposite）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的方向，相对于态射（morphism）<MATH_0002> 而言。如果 <MATH_0003> 是位点（sites）的态射（morphism），我们使用记号 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005>。函子（functor）<MATH_0006> 称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>拉回函子（pullback functor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，函子（functor）<MATH_0007> 称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>推前函子（pushforward functor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>。与拓扑（topology）中的情形一样，有如下伴随性（adjointness）性质\n<MATH_0008>\n这个定义的动机来自下面的例子。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"opposite","target_term":"相反"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pushforward functor","target_term":"推前函子"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"连续函子及诱导的两个层函子"},{"source_term":"opposite","target_term":"相反","context":"函子方向与位点态射方向相反"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定的位点态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"位点之间的态射"},{"source_term":"pullback functor","target_term":"拉回函子","context":"层上的左伴随"},{"source_term":"pushforward functor","target_term":"推前函子","context":"层上的右伴随"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"与拓扑中的通常定义比较"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"两个层函子间的伴随公式"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00X2:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为拓扑空间（topological spaces）的连续的（continuous）映射（map）。回顾，已有位点（sites）<MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>，见例 <REF_0001>。考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0004>，<MATH_0005>。这个函子（functor）显然是连续的（continuous），因为开（open）覆盖（coverings）的逆（inverse）像（images）仍是开（open）覆盖（coverings）。（实际上，这依赖于如何为 <MATH_0006> 和 <MATH_0007> 选取覆盖（coverings）的集合（sets）。但无论如何，这个函子（functor）都是拟连续的（quasi-continuous），见注记 <REF_0002>。）容易验证，函子（functor）<MATH_0008> 等于拓扑（topology）中通常的推前（pushforward）函子（functor）<MATH_0009>。因此，由于 <MATH_0010> 是伴随（adjoint），而通常的拓扑（topological）拉回（pullback）函子（functor）<MATH_0011> 也是伴随（adjoint），得到典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0012>。由于 <MATH_0013> 是正合的（exact），可推出 <MATH_0014> 是正合的（exact）。因此 <MATH_0015> 定义了位点（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>，也可以将其记为 <MATH_0017>，因为我们已看到函子（functors）<MATH_0018> 与通常的概念一致。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-continuous","target_term":"拟连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_t