{"unit_id":"tag:03CB:proof","translation":"由定义直接可知，<MATH_0001> 是连续的（continuous）函子（functor）。此外，显然有 <MATH_0002>，从而 <MATH_0003>。因此，函子（functors）<MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 都是 <MATH_0006> 的左伴随（left adjoints）。所以 <MATH_0007>，由此得出 <MATH_0008> 是正合的（exact），因为它是正合的（exact）函子（functors）的复合（composition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left adjoints","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"复合的连续性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"复合函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"比较的左伴随及正合函子"},{"source_term":"left adjoints","target_term":"左伴随","context":"同一函子的两个左伴随"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"复合保持正合性"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"正合函子的复合"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03CC:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>，<MATH_0002>，为位点（sites）。设 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 为位点（sites）的态射（morphisms），由连续的（continuous）函子（functors）<MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 给出。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>复合（composition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0007> 是位点（sites）的态射（morphism），对应于函子（functor）<MATH_0008>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"三个可复合的位点"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"两个给定的位点态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"定义态射的函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"两个给定函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"定义位点态射的复合"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所定义的复合态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"给出复合态射的函子"}],"notes":[]}
