{"unit_id":"tag:00X5:proof","translation":"由于 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的左伴随（left adjoint），可知 <MATH_0003> 是右正合的（right exact），见范畴（Categories）引理 <REF_0001>。因此只需说明 <MATH_0004> 是左正合的（left exact）。换言之，必须说明 <MATH_0005> 与有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes）。由于范畴（categories）<MATH_0006> 是滤过的（filtered），可知 <MATH_0007> 与有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes），见范畴（Categories）引理 <REF_0002>（这里也使用了 <MATH_0008> 中极限（limits）的描述，见第 <REF_0003> 节）。又由于层化（sheafification）也与有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes）（引理 <REF_0004>），并且 <MATH_0009>，所以得到结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"right exact","target_term":"右正合的"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"filtered","target_term":"滤过的"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随","context":"层上两个函子的伴随关系"},{"source_term":"right exact","target_term":"右正合的","context":"左伴随的右正合性"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章的引理"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的","context":"所需有限极限保持性"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限","context":"预层左伴随及层化保持的有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"与有限极限交换"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层左伴随的指标范畴"},{"source_term":"filtered","target_term":"滤过的","context":"指标范畴的假设"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"预层范畴中逐对象计算的极限"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"