{"unit_id":"tag:00X6:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为位点（sites）。设 <MATH_0003> 是连续的（continuous）。进一步假设：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 范畴（category）<MATH_0004> 有终对象（final object）<MATH_0005>，并且 <MATH_0006> 是 <MATH_0007> 的终对象（final object），并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 范畴（category）<MATH_0008> 有纤维积（fibre products），且 <MATH_0009> 与之交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n那么 <MATH_0010> 定义位点（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>，换言之，<MATH_0012> 是正合的（exact）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"给定的两个位点"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"函子的假设"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"连续函子的源范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"函子保持的终对象"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"源范畴存在且函子保持的纤维积"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"函子与纤维积交换"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所得位点态射"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"诱导层上左伴随的正合性"}],"notes":[]}
