{"unit_id":"tag:00X7:statement","translation":"上面命题 <REF_0001> 的条件等价于（equivalent）<MATH_0001> 是左正合的（left exact），即与有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes）。见范畴（Categories）引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。用终对象（final objects）和纤维积（fibre products）来表述似乎更自然，因为在各例中这样的表述似乎更有几何意义。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final objects","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于","context":"保持终对象及纤维积的等价表述"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的","context":"函子保持有限极限"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限","context":"左正合性所保持的极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"函子与有限极限交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章引理"},{"source_term":"final objects","target_term":"终对象","context":"命题中的具体条件"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"命题中的具体条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00X0:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n引理 <REF_0001> 将提供另一种方法，证明连续的（continuous）函子（functor）给出位点（sites）的态射（morphism）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"构造位点态射的连续函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"另一判据所作用的函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"函子的源和目标"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"判据所保证的位点态射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00X8:statement","translation":"（初读时可跳过。）\n设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为位点（sites）。类似于定义 <REF_0001>，我们说一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>位点拟态射（quasi-morphism of sites）<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> 由拟连续的（quasi-continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0004>（见注记 <REF_0002>）给出，并要求 <MATH_0005> 是正合的（exact）。在此语境下，命题 <REF_0003> 的类似结果可通过将“连续的（continuous）”替换为“拟连续的（quasi-continuous）”，并将“态射（morphism）”替换为“拟（quasi）态射（morphism）”得到。证明逐字相同。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-morphism of sites","target_term":"位点拟态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-continuous","target_term":"拟连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"quasi-continuous","target_term":"拟连续的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"给定的两个位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-morphism of sites","target_term":"位点拟态射","context":"本注记定义的拟态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-continuous","target_term":"拟连续的","context":"替代连续性的条件"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"给出拟态射的函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"诱导层上左伴随的要求"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"被替换的原条件名称"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所替换的名称及拟态射中的词根"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟","context":"quasi-morphism的前缀，按当前词根覆盖分解双语"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00X0:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在定义 <REF_0001> 中，<MATH_0001> 是正合的（exact）这一条件不能省略。例如，如果只假设 <MATH_0002> 是连续的（continuous），则下面引理的结论未必成立。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"位点态射定义中不可省略的条件"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"单独不足以推出下述结论的假设"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08H2:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（sites）的态射（morphism），由函子（functor）<MATH_0002> 给出。给定 <MATH_0003> 作为 <MATH_0004> 的任意对象（object），存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得对每个 <MATH_0006>，都存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，对于某个对象（object）<MATH_0008>（属于 <MATH_0009>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"给定态射的源和目标"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"位点态射及局部到函子像的态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"给出位点态射的连续函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"给定目标对象及局部对应的源对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部存在到函子像态射的覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08H2:proof","translation":"由于 <MATH_0001> 是正合的（exact），有 <MATH_0002>，其中 <MATH_0003> 表示层（sheaves）范畴（category）的终对象（final object）（例 <REF_0001>）。由于 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 的层化（sheafification），可知存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得 <MATH_0007> 非空（nonempty）。又由于 <MATH_0008> 是在范畴（category）<MATH_0009> 上取的余极限（colimit），其中对象（objects）是态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>，所以引理成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"拉回保持终对象"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"终对象所在的层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴及预层左伴随的指标范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"取值为单元素集合的层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"由预层左伴随得到层上左伴随"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"使预层取值非空的局部覆盖"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空","context":"保证局部存在指标对象"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限","context":"预层左伴随的取值"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"指标范畴的对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"指标对象对应的局部态射"}],"notes":[]}
